# What the sandbox image's build context leaves out (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore).
# The root .dockerignore is the same list, for a builder that reads only that one; a test keeps the
# two equal (packages/sandbox-kubernetes/src/infra.test.ts).
# Credentials first: no .env file of any kind reaches an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
.git
.verify
.ralph
.omp
.factory
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
